<title>USA: Indiana Area School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</title>
<headline>Indiana Area School District, Pa., adjusted TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Indiana Area School District, Pa., said Wedn esday it recalculated Mellon Bank's winning bid on the District's $9.260 million general obligation bond issue.</p>
<p>The District said the true interest cost was 4.6263 percent reflecting the c ost of insurance, not the 4.59 percent originally calculated.</p>
</text>
